(WHAT THE WEBSITE CURRENTLY DOES) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. Frontend experience) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The frontend renders a single-page shopping showcase with these major sections:) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (- **Sticky header** with navigation links and a login/explore CTA) Tj
T* (- **Hero section** describing the concept and showing runtime status) Tj
T* (- **Live categories** generated from the fetched product data) Tj
T* (- **Product spotlight grid** showing curated items) Tj
T* (- **System map & telemetry** cards summarizing the stack) Tj
T* (- **Footer** pointing users to source files and run instructions) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (2. Backend experience) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The backend exposes one main endpoint:) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (- `GET /api/products`) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (This endpoint returns:) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (- a `banner` string for the hero highlights) Tj
T* (- a `curated` product array) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Each product includes:) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (- `id`) Tj
T* (- `name`) Tj
T* (- `price`) Tj
T* (- `currency`) Tj
T* (- `badge`) Tj
T* (- `category`) Tj
T* (- `description`) Tj
T* (- `delivery`) Tj
T* (- `priceFormatted`) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The backend calculates `priceFormatted` using `Intl.NumberFormat\("en-IN"\)`, which keeps) Tj
T* (INR presentation consistent for the frontend.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (ARCHITECTURE OVERVIEW) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Frontend flow) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. `frontend/src/main.jsx` mounts the React app into `#root`.) Tj
T* (2. `frontend/src/App.jsx` manages page state.) Tj
T* (3. On first render, `useEffect` calls `fetch\("http://localhost:5174/api/products"\)`.) Tj
T* (4. The frontend stores:) Tj
T* (   - `products`) Tj
T* (   - `banner`) Tj
T* (   - `status`) Tj
T* (5. `useMemo` derives unique categories from the fetched product list.) Tj
T* (6. The UI updates based on loading, ready, or error state.) Tj
ET
endstream
